#: ../../source/docs/buttons.rst:5 c05fbca52d884f30bf8758c6f704cec5
msgid "Button Inputs in Sub"
msgstr "水下机器人的按钮输入"

#: ../../source/docs/buttons.rst:7 4260d8686d054fa5be9dc8e290aa8dd5
msgid ""
"Unlike other vehicles, Sub has its own specialized button functionality. "
"Other vehicles include hardware buttons as described in the :ref:`common-"
"buttons` hardware section."
msgstr "与其他载具不同，水下机器人拥有其独有的按钮功能。其他载具的硬件按钮说明请参见 :ref:`common-buttons` 硬件章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/buttons.rst:9 a7109c418dce43f2a6f23ba85177fe29
msgid ""
"Instead, Sub uses \"joystick\" buttons associated with the GCS or GCS "
"attached Joystick. The GCS sends frequent button state updates via the "
"`MAVLink Manual Control protocol "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html>`__, which includes both"
" motion-axis commands and button states."
msgstr ""
"水下机器人改为使用与 GCS 或 GCS 所接摇杆关联的「摇杆」按钮。GCS 通过 `MAVLink 手动控制协议 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html>`__ "
"频繁发送按钮状态更新，其中包含运动轴指令和按钮状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/buttons.rst:11 3316d49a6f554cb7849638d259304bbf
msgid ""
"Up to 32 buttons can be configured with a host of functions. In addition, by"
" assigning a \"shift\" button function, each button can execute a "
"\"shifted\" function, so up to 63 functions can be implemented."
msgstr ""
"最多可配置 32 个按钮，每个按钮对应多种功能。此外，通过分配「shift」按钮功能，每个按钮还可执行「shift」状态下的功能，最多可实现 63 "
"个功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/buttons.rst:13 9078e6b8c54a4d599cae28e07a37df72
msgid ""
"See :ref:`sub-hardware` for the default assignments of button functions."
msgstr "按钮功能的默认分配请参见 :ref:`sub-hardware`。"

